# Rayen OS — Virtual machine support
# - VMware: open-vm-tools-desktop (drag&drop, shared folders, clipboard)
# - QEMU/KVM: qemu-guest-agent + spice-vdagent (clipboard, resolution, sharing)
# - VirtualBox: runs with basic VGA via modesetting (no guest-additions shipped)
open-vm-tools-desktop
qemu-guest-agent
spice-vdagent
# Display drivers for common hypervisor framebuffers (fall back to modesetting)
xserver-xorg-video-qxl
xserver-xorg-video-vmware
